          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Equal variances $\\Rightarrow$ pooled $t$ with $df = n_1+n_2-2 = 20$:<br/>$$s_p^{2} = \\frac{(n_1-1)s_1^{2}+(n_2-1)s_2^{2}}{n_1+n_2-2} = \\frac{11(0.4)+9(0.5)}{20} = \\frac{8.9}{20} = 0.445,\\quad s_p = 0.6671.$$<br/>$$\\text{SE} = s_p\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1}{12}+\\tfrac{1}{10}} = 0.6671\\times0.4282 = 0.2856.$$<br/>Two-sided 90% $\\Rightarrow t_{0.05,20}=1.725$, margin $= 0.4926$, and $\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2 = 1.12$:<br/>$$(1.12-0.4926,\\ 1.12+0.4926) = (0.627,\\ 1.613).$$</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Phương sai bằng nhau $\\Rightarrow$ dùng $t$ gộp với $df = n_1+n_2-2 = 20$:<br/>$$s_p^{2} = \\frac{11(0{,}4)+9(0{,}5)}{20} = \\frac{8{,}9}{20} = 0{,}445,\\quad s_p = 0{,}6671.$$<br/>$$\\text{SE} = s_p\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1}{12}+\\tfrac{1}{10}} = 0{,}2856.$$<br/>Hai phía 90% $\\Rightarrow t_{0,05;20}=1{,}725$, biên sai số $= 0{,}4926$, và $\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2 = 1{,}12$:<br/>$$(1{,}12-0{,}4926;\\ 1{,}12+0{,}4926) = (0{,}627;\\ 1{,}613).$$</p></div>"
